# Scratch space the Claude Code harness creates in the repository root: isolated
# git worktrees for parallel agents. They are checkouts of this very repository,
# so committing them would nest the repo inside itself; they are also deleted the
# moment the agent that owns one finishes. Never project content.
.claude/worktrees/

# scratch files from screenshot passes
prototype/*.tmp.mjs

# Raw frame dumps cut from the designer's screen recordings (16.09.2026, the title
# hand-over). The analysis that matters — the contact sheet, the strips, the per-frame
# diffs — is committed next to them; the 122 raw JPEGs (6 MB) are not.
prototype/scratchpad/swap/frames/
prototype/scratchpad/publish-shrink/frames/
prototype/scratchpad/connect-exit/frames/
